        "successFeedback": "Yes — -5(x-3)=-5x+15, then -5x+2x=-3x, giving -3x+15."
      },
      "hints": [
        "Distribute -5 across (x-3): -5x+15 (same signs give +15).",
        "Combine the x-terms: -5x+2x=-3x.",
